            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.90</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>News about new features, right in the app.</b> A short note appears above the gallery when something new is available, and you can dismiss it with one click.</li>
<li><b>You may be asked a quick question.</b> Now and then a small card asks how you get on with a feature, or whether something is in your way. A thumb, two sentences, or a link to a short survey. Answering is always optional, and nothing ever blocks your work.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
