            <title>5.89</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 14:34:41 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>444</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>5.89</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.89</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>A document you attach counts as your own source.</b> Hand the agent a brand guide and tell it to remember, and the facts are stored right away. They used to arrive as candidates that had to be confirmed a second time, because only the text of your message counted as evidence. What the model concludes beyond the document still asks, and that prompt still shows exactly which sentence is about to be written.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
